  "releaseNotes": "Adds Profile.ClientSupportMultiTax, which enables the MultiTax feature by sending a\nClientSupportMultiTax element in the Profile SOAP header. It defaults to false, so the\nsingle-tax response shape is preserved until a caller opts in.\n\nThis is a DROP-IN upgrade from 16.8.0. AssemblyVersion remains 16.8.0.0, so existing\ndirect references and binding redirects keep working unchanged; only AssemblyFileVersion\nmoves to 16.8.1.0. No public API is removed, and no enum value changes - anything you have\npersisted continues to mean the same thing.\n\nTwo small carry-overs from source changes made after 16.8.0 shipped:\n* Members of Avalara.AvaTax.Adapter.LogService.LogLevel were re-cased (DEBUG -> Debug,\n  INFO -> Info, and so on). Numeric values are unchanged, so only source naming them needs\n  editing. The separate Avalara.AvaTax.Adapter.LogLevel enum keeps its upper-case names.\n* The LogSvc.LogMessage(string, LogLevel, string) overload was removed.\n\nSee the included README.md for usage and a configuration reference.",
